&_nc_oc=AdrDpj_QNcH-miRzae2migdjrOHpdwlXaYpGClSs2S-Ztj98cakVK5A-VPtoq2yOrYA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTn4AArireETcD-BNz4FILJUclPSgphZ8OuHBE-2c2W-Q&oe=6AF0923E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YHCoXtFQOV8Q7kNvwFDT9Js&_nc_oc=AdrisK16o6UUqRjeWXJFwdjM0npgkPubMpHNjjupQsxcE0WczhPLqhm3tvn-HK0Fnfk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRc7v3yUOo39oEjIhocIDsOUcNExtv59rGUOgIO99ROrA&oe=6AF0A33C"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OoH8N_5FMQ0Q7kNvwHk2d7U&_nc_oc=AdpDxqGpub40U9NWVwr51fBuC8x68JU1SbhbiKKHhR861GSF7QbgHpbuRXph2DvQg_8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT5ysqeEQiX6syWSYC0vCQRH6xHoOOQhctAhMeoUjIh2w&oe=6AF08987"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hPCXiJyajtkQ7kNvwGbSfsD&_nc_oc=AdpQaoeyFpUiCny2LTyVI1yDiL2i67deb1TTBWCbljVGNt0B3-f9Jl-Q_AyPZuO_5Ak&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS7TrrPGFYVrxn09Xi9Rs1lhJz_cn0N5ru7tkyA0mtgbA&oe=6AF0AD95"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=662uy7lJOzEQ7kNvwFfq34E&_nc_oc=Adq00E7c4x6Ry5Erzs3YP_Ne0ssyHPlyGMlJ-bcsqp0bPqG7DSj8puGoroLLcssaJ7E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTdznjUGFZGHbXjIuiuwJtXv97WZLjBVpjZ_z1vUTNRLQ&oe=6AF081E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.